{
  vertexes: [
    {
      id: "1"
      L: Page
      P: {
        public: true
        fns: return { enabled: () => true }
        title: Tutorial - Attendra
        url: /tutorial
        key: Tutorial
        props: '''return { isNoPermissionCheck: true };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "2"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id{ max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: ${t.var.spacing?.lg || "2rem"}; color:${t.var.color.text}; }
@media (max-width: 768px){ ._id{ padding:${t.var.spacing?.md || "1rem"}; } }`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as:"main" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "3"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as:"h1", text:"Tutorial" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "4"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 2
        componentName: Html
        textType: markdown
        css: '''return `._id{ margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; color:${t.var.color.text_light_500}; line-height:1.6; }`;'''
        text: Follow these steps to get Attendra running in minutes.
        props: '''return { as: "div" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "5"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 3
        componentName: Html
        textType: markdown
        css: '''return `._id{ margin: 0; color:${t.var.color.text}; line-height:1.75; }`;'''
        text:
          '''### 1) Install + open Attendra

Install **Attendra** from the Shopify App Store and open it inside your Shopify admin.

### 2) Set business settings

Open **Settings** (`/settings`) and confirm:

- timezone
- workday start/end
- late threshold minutes

### 3) Add employees

Go to **Employees** (`/employees`) and add staff (email, name, username, roles, status). Invitation email is sent on create when configured.

### 4) Staff access

Staff use the **portal sign-in** URL for your shop (see **Dashboard → Portal Url**).

### 5) Review time

Use **Time Logs** (`/time-logs`) for detailed history and **Dashboard** (`/app`) for “who’s in now”.
'''
        props: '''return { as:"div", textType:"markdown" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "layout"
      L: PageLayout
      P: {
        componentName: ShopifyLayout
      }
    }
  ]
  edges: [
    {
      id: "e1"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "1"
      E: "2"
    }
    {
      id: "e2"
      T: "PageLayout"
      S: "1"
      E: "layout"
    }
    {
      id: "e3"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "2"
      E: "3"
    }
    {
      id: "e4"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "2"
      E: "4"
    }
    {
      id: "e5"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "2"
      E: "5"
    }
  ]
}

